WEBVTT

00:00:29.465 --> 00:00:30.924
ALBERTA: Eustace?

00:00:31.967 --> 00:00:35.929
Eustace, what are you doing up there?

00:00:36.013 --> 00:00:38.891
Jill Pole's dropped in for a visit.

00:00:50.319 --> 00:00:53.238
EUSTACE: We spoke often of Narnia
in the days that followed.

00:00:55.908 --> 00:00:59.828
And when my cousins left,
after the war ended...

00:01:01.497 --> 00:01:04.249
...I missed them with all my heart.

00:01:06.126 --> 00:01:08.671
As I know all Narnians will miss them...

00:01:09.797 --> 00:01:11.173
...till the end of time.

